First release of Dyslexic Reader.

Open PDFs, Word docs and text and read them your way: adjustable spacing, legible fonts and gentle themes, a draggable reading ruler, and read-aloud that highlights each word as it's spoken. Plus on-device OCR for scanned PDFs, in-document search, bookmarks and notes.

Free, no ads, and fully on-device — your documents never leave your phone.
